Mimbrob specimen stubs — mock reconstructions from public IOCs (inert).

No live malware is stored here.  Files are minimal byte strings assembled
from indicators published in the F6 report (2026-09-29) so that the YARA
rules can be smoke-tested without access to the original binaries.

